# Loaded by `vite --mode extension` (npm run build:extension): the browser extensions' build of the
# web app (HITOP Next A8). Requests to public hosts go through hitop.rws8.tech's proxy and bridges,
# like the web app (timing phases, WebSocket handshake headers, gRPC; owner decision 2026-11-10;
# hitop-server accepts the extensions' Origins, server/src/origins.rs). Localhost and private
# networks go straight from the extension page, which its host_permissions allow.
VITE_HITOP_PLATFORM=extension
VITE_HITOP_PROXY=https://hitop.rws8.tech/api/proxy
